## 2. Source paper (02_source_paper/)

The IEEE TKDE 2025 paper "ST-LLM+: Graph Enhanced Spatio-Temporal Large
Language Models for Traffic Prediction" by Liu et al. is © IEEE and is
included in `02_source_paper/TKDE Popular Paper.pdf` strictly for academic,
non-commercial, educational, and research use under IEEE's personal-use
policy. All rights in the paper itself remain with IEEE and the original
authors. Any redistribution of the paper beyond personal academic use
requires separate permission from IEEE.

## 3. TimeMMD dataset (12_dataset/)

The TimeMMD dataset (Liu et al., NeurIPS 2024 Datasets and Benchmarks Track,
arXiv:2406.08627) is distributed under the **Open Data Commons Attribution
License v1.0 (ODC-By v1.0)**. See:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/

The dataset was obtained from the Hugging Face mirror
`AndrewRWilliams/time-mmd-DC`, which redistributes the official AdityaLab
TimeMMD data. Upstream repo: https://github.com/AdityaLab/TimeMMD
(as of 2026-08-09 the upstream repo returns HTTP 404).

Under ODC-By v1.0 you are free to: share, create, and adapt the dataset,
provided you attribute the source. The recommended attribution is:

> Liu, H., Xu, S., Zhao, Z., Kong, L., Kamarthi, H., Sasanur, A. B.,
> Sharma, M., Cui, J., Wen, Q., Zhang, C., & Prakash, B. A. (2024).
> Time-MMD: A New Multi-Domain Multimodal Dataset for Time Series Analysis.
> NeurIPS 2024 Datasets and Benchmarks Track. arXiv:2406.08627.

## 4. BERT-base-uncased weights

The `bert-base-uncased` model (used as the text encoder, downloaded at runtime
from https://huggingface.co/google-bert/bert-base-uncased) is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 by Google. See:
https://huggingface.co/google-bert/bert-base-uncased/blob/main/LICENSE

