- **Sahel** (by Saber Rastikerdar): licensed under the SIL Open Font
  License 1.1. See https://github.com/rastikerdar/sahel-font

## 6. Thesis reports (01_final_deliverables/)

The Persian and English thesis reports (DOCX + PDF) are © 2026 the thesis
author, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License (CC BY 4.0). See: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

## 7. Third-party Python packages

Each Python package listed in `10_mvgtnet_code/requirements.txt` retains its
own license. The bundle does not modify or relicense any third-party package.

